      "message": "I assume this source is unmodified, correct?\n\nEven if the file is modified, we need to first check this file into platform/ec/third_party to comply with our licensing requirements, and then make changes.\n\nCan you provide me info about the source of this file?  Here is an example file that includes the required details.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/third_party/zephyr/METADATA;l\u003d1\n\nI\u0027ll work with our licensing team to get this file landed.\n\nYou\u0027ll have to modify your CMake to reference the new location once it has landed.",
